        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, electric bicycle, LiNCM battery</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, electric bicycle, LiNCM battery
The data set reflects the disposal of an electric  bike of 24kg. Aluminium and steel parts are fully recycled. Plastics are incinerated, batteries are treated.;
UUID: d23226a5-60f0-4a8d-b9e9-b0ef7bf3183c
This data set includes the disposal of all remaining parts, that are not recycled. All recycled parts are attributed to the reuse process (cut-off). Transport for recycled materials included.
Location: Data for disposal of vehicle parts in Europe.
Technology: unknown
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: Some data derived from car disposal
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_d23226a5-60f0-4a8d-b9e9-b0ef7bf3183c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
